      "side": 1,
      "message": "The case seems to happen with PostExecutionState \u003d\u003d ON_RESUME, so it may be running ActivityResultItem or NewIntentItem.\n\nIf want to ignore the item action, then return UNDEFINED as the current modification. \n\nOtherwise either return ON_CREATE or set currentState to PRE_ON_CREATE then getLifecyclePath can return PRE_ON_CREATE + 1.",
